/Title (Description: ConstructAI utilizes a modular three-tier architecture designed for rapid multimodal visual reasoning and persistent civil engineering record-keeping. The client layer comprises a responsive React 18 single-page application built with Vite and Tailwind CSS. The middle tier runs an asynchronous FastAPI ASGI application server orchestrating JWT token validation, Pydantic schema enforcement, and multipart payload streams. The backend connects to the Groq Cloud LPU inference cluster for accelerated model execution, backed by a persistent relational schema.)
